晰。\n\n一张充满夏日氛围的场景图，浅蓝牛仔短裤挂在木质衣架上，背景是海边冲浪店与沙滩，阳光明媚，画面留白处写有活泼的中文文案“夏日百搭”，电影级光影，色彩明快，高调摄影。\n\n一张OOTD平铺展示图，水洗牛仔短裤搭配简约白T恤和帆布鞋，整齐摆放在浅色木地板上，画面中心带有现代感的中文字体“经典穿搭”，俯拍视角，柔和自然光，日系杂志风格。\n\n一张强调面料特性的创意图，牛仔短裤在微风中轻盈悬浮，背景是清透的蔚蓝天空，画面右侧写有清爽的中文文案“透气舒适”，高速摄影，通透感，极简主义。\n\n一张背面细节特写图，聚焦短裤的后口袋与立体双车线，背景为复古棕色皮革，画面左上角带有硬朗的中文文案“立体剪裁”，高对比度光影，质感大片，8k画质。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 251, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "type": "easy showAnything", "title": "预览", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [475.2271728515625, 563.0508422851562], "pos": [2050.93701171875, 207.3125762939453], "id": 11, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [140, 46], "color": "#432", "pos": [3071.56787109375, 266.576904296875], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "zip", "link": 255, "label": "zip", "type": "*", "localized_name": "zip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "命名信息", "label": "命名信息", "type": "*", "localized_name": "命名信息"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 115, "type": "HAIGC_SaveImagesToZip", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "HAIGC_SaveImagesToZip"}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["alanchow"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 7, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "SaveImage", "title": "保存图片", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [884.55078125, 810.952392578125], "pos": [2947.788818359375, 266.9915771484375], "id": 8, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 14}], "extra": {"links_a